+ *
+ * MACRUNNER_QPC_FAST=1: RtlQueryPerformanceCounter computes, without leaving user mode, the same value
+ * NtQueryPerformanceCounter returns (unix monotonic_counter = mach_continuous_time * numer / denom / 100):
